# SABOTAGE: T78 (spec §I5 helpdesk knowledge base + composer suggestion + deflection) —
# drops the `org_id == ^org_id` conjunct from `Samen.Scopes.Cms.PublicPostFilter.prepare/3`,
# the ENTIRE authorization surface for `Post.:read_public` (the unauthenticated tenant-
